<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Our Imaginary Ceremony · ZEEL × VRUSH</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/style.css"></head><body data-page="gift"><div class="app"><div class="noise"></div><div class="orb"></div><div class="topbar"></div><main><section class="page-hero"><span class="tag">gift 14 · one of eighteen</span><h1>Our Imaginary Ceremony</h1><p>A playful future ceremony page — soft, silly and cinematic.</p></section><div class="two"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Arrival</div><h2 style="margin:8px 0;font-family:DM Serif Display,serif">Music starts. Everyone is pretending to be calm.</h2><p class="tiny">Music starts. Everyone is pretending to be calm.</p></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">The look</div><h2 style="margin:8px 0;font-family:DM Serif Display,serif">One look across the room. Suddenly the room becomes background.</h2><p class="tiny">One look across the room. Suddenly the room becomes background.</p></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">The vow</div><h2 style="margin:8px 0;font-family:DM Serif Display,serif">Keep laughing. Keep choosing each other. Keep making ordinary days memorable.</h2><p class="tiny">Keep laughing. Keep choosing each other. Keep making ordinary days memorable.</p></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">The chaos</div><h2 style="margin:8px 0;font-family:DM Serif Display,serif">Someone says something completely stupid. We laugh at the wrong time.</h2><p class="tiny">Someone says something completely stupid. We laugh at the wrong time.</p></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">The food</div><h2 style="margin:8px 0;font-family:DM Serif Display,serif">Because every ceremony needs food. Non-negotiable.</h2><p class="tiny">Because every ceremony needs food. Non-negotiable.</p></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">The end</div><h2 style="margin:8px 0;font-family:DM Serif Display,serif">We leave together and immediately start planning the next thing.</h2><p class="tiny">We leave together and immediately start planning the next thing.</p></div></div><div class="footer"><a class="cta" href="home.html">← Back to all 18 gifts</a></div></main></div><script src="../assets/app.js"></script></body></html>